  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: MachineGunTeam
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Machine Gun Team
  role: 2
  description: A heavy fire base. The Machine Gunner fires 5 shots a volley (5 damage,
    penetration 1, 20 m each) but can't fire after moving, so set the team up covering
    a firing lane and let it hold there. Three SMG troopers add close-range firepower
    out to 10 m and protect the gun; the Sergeant carries only a pistol. With five
    soldiers and no grenade, it's best covering ground rather than leading an assault.
    Heavy Support can be taken more than once.
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fa6a4aec26cf1d64eb0a647a90c0367e, type: 2}
